@startuml name

!pragma teoz true

skinparam Style strictuml
skinparam Monochrome reverse

actor "Client 1" as A
participant Server
actor "Client 2" as B

A -> Server: GET /version
Server -> A: 200 OK\n接続を許可するプロトコルバージョンの一覧 (例: [1])
A -> Server: POST /rooms/new\n本文は HttpRoomConfig (または {})
note over Server: 部屋を作成
Server -> A: 201 Created\n{success: true, room_id: RoomId}
A -> Server: GET /rooms/{room_id}
Server -> A: 200 OK\nRoomData (設定，手番，プレイヤー，盤面)
A -> Server: GET /rooms/{room_id}/ws?v=1
A <-> Server: 接続を確立
activate Server
Server -> A: t=InitialRoomState (100), c=RoomData

A -> B: 部屋の URL を伝える

B -> Server: GET /version
Server -> B: 200 OK\n同上
B -> Server: GET /rooms/{room_id}
Server -> B: 200 OK\nRoomData
B -> Server: GET /rooms/{room_id}/ws?v=1
B <-> Server: 接続を確立
activate Server
Server -> B: t=InitialRoomState (100), c=RoomData

== 参加 ==

A -> Server: t=JoinTeam (0), c=SideA
note over Server: プレイヤー 1 を作成
Server -> A: t=PlayerJoin (4), i=PublicIdA, c=[SideA, NameA]
& Server -> B: t=PlayerJoin (4), i=PublicIdA, c=[SideA, NameA]
Server -> A: t=UserCreated (101)\nc={success: true, private_id: PrivateIdA, public_id: PublicIdA}
note left of A: PlayerJoin が UserCreated より先に届く
A -> Server: t=Resume (1), c=PrivateIdA
Server -> A: t=Authorized (102)

B -> Server: t=JoinTeam (0), c=SideB
note over Server: プレイヤー 2 を作成
Server -> A: t=PlayerJoin (4), i=PublicIdB, c=[SideB, NameB]
& Server -> B: t=PlayerJoin (4), i=PublicIdB, c=[SideB, NameB]
Server -> B: t=UserCreated (101)\nc={success: true, private_id: PrivateIdB, public_id: PublicIdB}
B -> Server: t=Resume (1), c=PrivateIdB
Server -> B: t=Authorized (102)

== 対局 ==

A -> Server: t=Move (3), c=[[x1, y1], [x2, y2]]
alt 動かせない場合
  Server -> A: t=ActionNotAccepted (103), c=理由
else 動かせる場合
  Server -> A: t=MovePiece (3), i=PublicIdA\nc=[手番が移るか, [[x1, y1], [x2, y2]]]
  & Server -> B: t=MovePiece (3), i=PublicIdA\nc=[手番が移るか, [[x1, y1], [x2, y2]]]
end
note left of A: 各操作はサーバーの応答を待ってから送ること

...and so on...

== 切断と復帰 ==

A ->x Server: 切断
deactivate Server
note over Server: 猶予 (60 秒) が始まる
A -> Server: GET /rooms/{room_id}/ws?v=1
A <-> Server: 接続を確立
activate Server
Server -> A: t=InitialRoomState (100), c=RoomData
A -> Server: t=Resume (1), c=PrivateIdA
alt 猶予内
  Server -> A: t=Authorized (102)
else 猶予切れ
  Server -> A: t=SessionExpired (104)
  note left of A: JoinTeam からやり直す
end

== 退出 ==

B -> Server: t=LeaveTeam (2)
Server -> A: t=PlayerLeave (5), i=PublicIdB
& Server -> B: t=PlayerLeave (5), i=PublicIdB
note right of B: PlayerLeave はプレイヤーの参加猶予切れの際も配信される

@enduml
